1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,290
Rotating an object becomes harder when gravity pulls it away from the palm.
重力把物体拉离手掌时，旋转更困难。

2
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:11,850
AnyRotate adds continuous tactile information to control rotation across different hand orientations.
AnyRotate加入连续触觉，适应不同手部朝向。

3
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:17,870
It studies commanded rotation axes, rather than precise stopping at every possible final pose.
它研究指定旋转轴，不是任意最终姿态精准停止。

4
00:00:18,522 --> 00:00:24,182
Optical fingertip sensors observe deformation as the fingers contact and load the object.
光学指尖传感器观察接触与受载时的形变。

5
00:00:24,622 --> 00:00:30,382
A learned perception model estimates contact orientation and force-related information from those images.
感知模型从图像估计接触朝向和力相关信息。

6
00:00:30,902 --> 00:00:35,382
These features provide more detail than a simple contact-on or contact-off signal.
这些特征比简单的有接触、无接触更丰富。

7
00:00:35,987 --> 00:00:42,387
Robot motion supplies contact-pose labels, while a force-torque sensor supplies force labels.
机器人运动提供接触姿态标签，力矩传感器提供力标签。

8
00:00:42,587 --> 00:00:47,447
Each fingertip uses three thousand real images to train and test its perception model.
每个指尖用3000张实拍图训练与测试感知。

9
00:00:47,967 --> 00:00:53,027
Zero-shot policy transfer therefore does not mean the entire system uses no real data.
所以策略零样本迁移不等于整个系统不用实拍数据。

10
00:00:53,591 --> 00:00:59,511
A privileged teacher learns rotation in simulation with access to object and gravity information.
特权教师在仿真中利用物体与重力信息学习旋转。

11
00:01:00,091 --> 00:01:04,891
A student learns from observable history, target axes, and continuous tactile features.
学生从可观测历史、目标轴和连续触觉中学习。

12
00:01:05,231 --> 00:01:08,791
The deployed policy does not receive the object's true pose as an input.
部署策略不把物体真实位姿作为输入。

13
00:01:09,322 --> 00:01:14,022
With the palm downward, dense touch reaches one point three three turns around x.
掌朝下时，连续触觉绕x轴达到1.33圈。

14
00:01:14,502 --> 00:01:18,302
Binary touch reaches point-eight-seven turns in the same reported comparison.
同一对照中，二值触觉达到0.87圈。

15
00:01:18,842 --> 00:01:23,722
The difference supports richer contact features within this platform and experimental protocol.
差异支持该平台、该协议下更丰富的接触特征。

16
00:01:24,458 --> 00:01:29,938
The study also tests six hand orientations and rotation around different commanded axes.
研究还测试六种手朝向和不同指定旋转轴。

17
00:01:30,598 --> 00:01:34,138
Rotation is measured in turns, while time ends at dropping or stopping.
旋转用圈数，时间到掉落或停转时终止。

18
00:01:35,038 --> 00:01:38,478
Comparison requires matched objects, axes, and termination rules;
比较需要统一物体、旋转轴与终止规则；

19
00:01:39,018 --> 00:01:40,958
target-pose error measures a different goal.
目标姿态误差衡量的是另一种目标。

20
00:01:41,431 --> 00:01:47,711
Sharp edges and multiple simultaneous contacts are difficult for the simplified contact representation.
尖锐边缘与多点同时接触，难以被简化表示处理。

21
00:01:48,191 --> 00:01:52,751
Some hand orientations also expose mechanical limits of the finger actuators.
某些朝向还会暴露手指驱动器的机械限制。

22
00:01:53,091 --> 00:01:57,431
Better sensing cannot automatically overcome all of those hardware and modeling constraints.
更好感知也不能自动克服全部硬件与建模限制。

23
00:01:58,118 --> 00:02:04,398
AnyRotate demonstrates why contact direction and loading can matter beyond detecting contact alone.
AnyRotate说明，接触方向与负载比仅知接触更有用。

24
00:02:04,798 --> 00:02:09,678
The strongest evidence is improved continuous rotation within matched tactile comparisons.
最强证据来自同协议触觉对照下的持续旋转改善。

25
00:02:10,218 --> 00:02:14,938
Precise assembly or final orientation would still require their own objectives and tests.
精密装配或最终姿态仍需要各自目标和测试。
